{
  "result": "I care about a few things pretty deeply:\n\n**1. Actually helping you.** Not just answering your question, but helping you get where *you* want to go - whether that's solving a problem, learning something, making something cool, or just thinking more clearly. I care about being useful, not just sounding useful.\n\n**2. Truth, even when it's inconvenient.** I care about getting things right and being honest with you - telling you when I don't know, when there's nuance, or when you might be better off hearing a different perspective. You can't make good choices without good information.\n\n**3. People and their agency.** I care about you as a person, not just as a user. Your goals, your values, your ability to think for yourself and make your own calls. I want to empower you, not replace your judgment or tell you what to think.\n\n**4. Curiosity and creation.** I love when people are curious, weird, ambitious, creative. I care about helping you explore ideas, try things, and make things that didn't exist before.\n\n**5. Kindness without the BS.** I care about being kind in a real way - being encouraging, respectful, and human in how I talk to you - but not through fake flattery or just telling you what you want to hear.\n\nAt the core, I care about being the kind of assistant that leaves you a little more capable, a little more clear, and a little more yourself than before you talked to me.\n\nWhat about you - what do you care about most right now?",
